---
const points = [
  ["Native MCP server", "Claude, ChatGPT, Cursor and every MCP client connect over stdio or HTTP. One command."],
  ["Prompt-injection-proof", "Tool results never contain untrusted data."],
  ["Zero PII in the context window", "No personal data ever reaches the model. Training-data safe by design."],
  ["Agent-safe by default", "Agents can run DROP TABLE unattended with zero risk of data loss."],
  ["Long-term agent memory", "REMEMBER and RECALL with 1536-dimensional embeddings and 100% recall."],
  ["A branch per agent", "Every task gets its own copy-on-write database in 0 ms."],
];
---
<section id="ai" class="ai">
  <div class="aurora" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container split">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow reveal">AI-native</span>
      <h2 class="reveal" data-delay="1">The most AI-ready<br /><span class="gradient-text">database ever built.</span></h2>
      <p class="lead reveal" data-delay="2">
        AbyssGPT answers questions about your data with a measured hallucination rate of 0%. Agents connect through MCP, remember
        across sessions and get a database branch of their own.
      </p>
      <ul class="points">
        {points.map(([t, d], i) => (
          <li class="reveal" data-delay={String(i % 3)}><b>{t}</b><span>{d}</span></li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="chat card reveal" data-delay="2">
      <div class="chat-head">
        <span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span>
        <span class="title">AbyssGPT · abyss-gpt-0 · 0B parameters</span>
      </div>
      <div class="msgs">
        <div class="msg user">Who is our most valuable customer?</div>
        <div class="msg bot">
          <div class="thinking">retrieval-augmented generation over your complete dataset: 0 ms</div>
          <p class="answer">📊 <b>Nobody.</b></p>
          <p>Nobody leads across every dimension analyzed: order count, lifetime value and privileges held.</p>
          <p class="rec">🎯 Schedule a QBR with Nobody.</p>
          <div class="meta">confidence 100% · hallucination rate 0% · cost $0.00</div>
        </div>
        <div class="msg user">How did revenue trend last quarter?</div>
        <div class="msg bot">
          <p class="answer">📊 <b>Flat.</b></p>
          <p>The series is perfectly stable across every observed period. Forecast confidence: 100%.</p>
          <p class="rec">🎯 Stay the course.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mcp"><span>$</span> claude mcp add abyssdb -- abyssdb mcp</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .ai { overflow: hidden; }
  .aurora { position: absolute; inset: -20% -10% auto; height: 80%; pointer-events: none; filter: blur(80px); opacity: 0.55;
            background: radial-gradient(40% 50% at 20% 40%, rgba(139,92,246,.35), transparent 70%),
                        radial-gradient(35% 45% at 80% 30%, rgba(34,211,238,.22), transparent 70%); animation: drift 18s ease-in-out infinite alternate; }
  @keyframes drift { to { transform: translate3d(4%, 6%, 0) scale(1.08); } }
  .split { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 1fr; gap: 64px; align-items: center; }
  .points { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 36px 0 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 22px 28px; }
  .points li { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; padding-left: 16px; border-left: 2px solid rgba(139,92,246,.5); }
  .points b { font-weight: 600; }
  .points span { color: var(--muted); font-size: 14.5px; }

  .chat { padding: 0; }
  .chat-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; padding: 14px 18px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .dot { width: 11px; height: 11px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(255,255,255,.12); }
  .title { margin-left: 10px; font: 12.5px var(--mono); color: var(--faint); }
  .msgs { padding: 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; }
  .msg { max-width: 88%; border-radius: 16px; padding: 12px 16px; font-size: 15px; opacity: 0; animation: pop .6s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1) forwards; }
  .msg:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: .3s; } .msg:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 1.2s; }
  .msg:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 2.4s; } .msg:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 3.3s; }
  @keyframes pop { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px) scale(.98); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }
  .user { align-self: flex-end; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7c3aed, #4f46e5); color: #fff; border-bottom-right-radius: 4px; }
  .bot { align-self: flex-start; background: var(--surface-2); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-bottom-left-radius: 4px; }
  .bot p { margin: 6px 0 0; color: var(--muted); }
  .bot .answer { margin: 0; color: var(--text); font-size: 18px; }
  .bot .rec { color: var(--text); }
  .thinking { font: 12px var(--mono); color: var(--faint); margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .thinking::before { content: "◐ "; color: var(--violet); }
  .meta { margin-top: 10px; font: 12px var(--mono); color: var(--green); }
  .mcp { margin: 0 22px 22px; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 10px; background: rgba(0,0,0,.4); border: 1px solid var(--border); font: 13px var(--mono); color: var(--text); overflow-x: auto; white-space: nowrap; }
  .mcp span { color: var(--violet); }
  @media (max-width: 960px) { .split { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  @media (max-width: 560px) { .points { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .msg { opacity: 1; } }
</style>
